:"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすっごく仲良しだから団結力もすごくて、めーっちゃ楽しかった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあみのクラスは、大阪名物たませんを売りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪出身の方、知ってるかなぁ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょー美味しいんですよこれがまた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になった方は作り方簡単だから食べてみるべしっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまってた質問返しをやりまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.もし、あみちゃんが男性やったら、メンバーで、誰を彼女にしたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーとねえー、七瀬かまひろか飛鳥かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみのその面白い存在感はどこで磨かれたんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーわかんなーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に面白くしてるつもりはないよおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、俺は来週テストだけどあみもテスト？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あみはまだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ勉強始めなきゃやばいっす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみはカラオケ好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし得意な曲、好きな曲があれば教えて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あみの18番は、松田聖子さんの天子のウインクだよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必ず歌うのさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみちゃんは将来のこととか決めたりしてるー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.うん、なんとなく自分の中の目標はあるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、質問だけど、クリスマスとか冬休みは何か計画してますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.特に何もぉ～。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事だったら嬉しいね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、メンバーで憧れる子とかいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んー...若月とか！すごい努力家なイメージがあるっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.でもそんなたくさんのファンに選抜入りお祝いされるのってどうよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それは本当に嬉しい事だよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても幸せな気持ちになる！おめでとうっていっぱい言われると！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、質問とはちょっと違うけど、何か絵を書いて載せてちょうだいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うぅ。。わかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの最も苦手としている絵を皆様に今度お見せします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 愛未Ｔシャツ、何色が良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ピンク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ぼく神奈川県のコンビ二（デイリー）でバイトしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんにすげー似てる人が今日東スポ探しに来たんだけど本人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そう...かもしれないですね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりだあ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、バーベキューのキノコの話をしたけど記憶にあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーなんとなく覚えてるよお(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.まあやちゃんは美味しい？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ぷにぷにしてておいしいよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、この五月から受験ってことで握手会は我慢してるけど、あみあみに会いたくてたまらん！どうするべきやと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.でもさ、今は勉強を頑張らなきゃいけないのよね...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもずーっと勉強ばっかりなんて可哀想すぎる！たまには息抜きとしてあみの握手会来ても良いと思うよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ぽこってゆうあだ名アレンジしてくださいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ぽこりん！ぽこりんはいかが？？可愛い(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、秋の味覚は柿ですがwww冬に食べたいものは ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.冬かぁ～、みかんと海のカキだな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、握手会でどんな話が楽しいですか??ぶっちゃけちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはどんな話も楽しいよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方の事とかでも喜んで聴くしっ！お互いの趣味の話でもいんじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、今１番ハマってる事や物や行為を教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ハマってることは人の目を見つめること！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみは「乃木どこ」の中でやってみたい企画とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.なんだろーなー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰れま10的な事もやってみたいかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.やっぱり握手会とか行ったほうがいいのかなあみあみどうおもう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うーん、あみは来て欲しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみ族入会したい場合手続きいりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.手続きなんかいらんっぺ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのこと好きだ。って気づいた瞬間あなたはもう自動的にあみあみ族！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみは男装とか似合いそうだけど男装のコスプレってした事ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したいと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん、前したことあるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装のコスプレは嫌いじゃない！！むしろ好き(*^o^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみってなんでそんなに、目ぱっちりしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.してないよまったく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと大きくぱっちりなりたい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/6103335/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.おいシャン全握で俺と握手してるけど覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.覚えてるに決まってるよおっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、彼氏いる子好きになったんですが無謀ですかね!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.無謀戦いなんてない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で好きなら気持ちだけでも伝えるべきだと思うよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、握手会行けないけどファンでいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.本当はめちゃくちゃ来て欲しいけど......来れないなら仕方ないよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンでいて下さいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、寒くなるとめっちゃ霜焼けで手足が真紫になる事あるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは霜焼け経験ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.しもやけ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないよおー！どんな感じだろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、北海道人だって言ったんだけど、分かるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わかるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、僕は朝に弱いんですが、あみあみはどうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.朝の弱さは私も負けません！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママに叩き起こされないかぎり起きれません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.私服の写真、ブルー系よく見かけるけど、あみあみはブルー系が好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んー好きだけどいろんなの着るよー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、そろそろ中間テストなんだけどあみのこと考えすぎて集中できません、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れるようになにか一言ください！一言じゃなくてもいいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑長ければ長いほど嬉しかったりする(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.学生の時のテストってさ、人生のなかでいうと本当に少しの期間じゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのたった少しの期間をどれだけ頑張れるかが大事だと思うよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみも乃木坂が大変だと思う時あるけど、それでもこれが自分にとって力になるならあみは今を精一杯がんばる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、また、あみあみ族に復帰してもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.おかえりなさい(*^^*)！もう離れちゃダメだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、このままずぅーっとあみあみ単独推しメンで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたいのですが・・・。女子ファンってどう思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.すっごい嬉しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のファン大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、４枚目のシングルは、どういう感じの歌ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の代表曲となりそうな曲ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それは、聞いてからのお楽しみっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最高な仕上がりになってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次も大量の質問返しやるからね！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃぁねぇー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/6103335/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-23132":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、無事、高校を卒業しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/03/13/3111876/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂と共に送った3年間は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いようで、とても早く過ぎていきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学3年生でオーデションに受かって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入ってから高校受験をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうして受かった高校。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入っていなかったらもっと別の高校だったかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入っていなかったらこの友達にも出会っていなかったかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう考えると、すごい巡り合わせで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま、たくさんの人と出会えてるんだなと感動します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂との両立はとても大変で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直諦めたくなるときもたくさんありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも支えてくれた家族、メンバー、友達、スタッフさん、そしてファンの方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に支えられてこうして卒業を迎えられています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのことに、本当感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間の3年間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいことも、嬉しいことも、悲しいことも、悔しいことも、たくさん経験してきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生忘れない日々になると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に、ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ついに、この春からは大学生になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治大学の文学部です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学との両立は、高校よりも厳しいものになると覚悟しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今自分にできる最大限のことにチャレンジして、たくさんの経験を積んで、立派な人間になりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦をしないで、後悔はしたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思ったので、大学進学を決意しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、変わらずに頑張っていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援、よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/03/13/3111876/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}}